  "body": "# What's changed\r\n\r\n* Added AI policy (9a3667fabe672af06d20136869b42b1f02775a64)\r\n* Fix graphics probe and enable emotes in Rex terminal (#726)\r\n* Bumped rust version from 1.85 to 1.100 (62acb69e7bfb9ea2be3e1ff9813b1ada6638dc77)\r\n\r\n# Contributors\r\n\r\nThank you @dmmulroy!\r\n\r\n# More information\r\n\r\nRelease available on [crates.io](https://crates.io/crates/twitch-tui).\r\n\r\nDownload the binary through `cargo install twitch-tui --version \"3.0.1\"`.\r\n\r\nDocumentation available [here](https://xithrius.github.io/twitch-tui/).\r\n\r\nIf you have any issues/suggestions don't hesitate to [submit a ticket](https://github.com/Xithrius/twitch-tui/issues/new/choose)! \r\n\r\nFull changelog: https://github.com/Xithrius/twitch-tui/compare/v3.0.0...v3.0.1",
